From: shaka456 <shaka456@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 11:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Fix AHB format for Samsung OneUI camera

Samsung camera allocates AHardwareBuffers with
AHARDWAREBUFFER_FORMAT_IMPLEMENTATION_DEFINED.  When the DRM
fourcc is resolved successfully, set p->format to the concrete
external_format instead of leaving it as VK_FORMAT_UNDEFINED.

This prevents a SIGSEGV in Skia's GrVkCaps::onGetReadSwizzle()
when the camera app switches modes or records video.

 src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c b/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
index abcdef1..1234567 100644
--- a/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
+++ b/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
@@ -925,6 +925,7 @@ get_ahb_buffer_format_properties2(
    }

+   p->format = external_format;
 finish:

    device->physical->dispatch_table.GetPhysicalDeviceFormatProperties2(
